NNECT HIGHLIGHTS! Palantir Software Engineering Intern Required Majors: Computer Science Location: Washington D.C. Shimadu HPLC Service Intern Required Majors: Engineering Location: Columbia, MD See Where our Alumni Work Get help using 'See Where our Alumni Work' Capitol Technology University graduates are in high demand. Here is a list of some of the employers that hired our graduates. The Office of Career Service Get help using 'The Office of Career Service' Contact Information Career Pathways & Employer Relations Manager C259 careers@captechu.edu Business Hours: 8:30am - 5:00pm Monday-Friday Meetings with the Office of Career Services can be scheduled via careers@captechu.edu Standing Office Hours: Tues-Thurs, 9:30am- 3:00pm Upcoming Events Get help using 'Upcoming Events' Fall 2026 Career Fair - October 16th, 2026 Spring 2027 Career Fair- March 12, 2026 Policy statement About us Contact us Powered by Jenzabar. v2024.2"
